stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading
  Loading --> Ready: Read succeeds
  Loading --> Unavailable: Read fails
  Unavailable --> Ready: Refresh succeeds
  Ready --> Pending: Approve or skip
  Pending --> Ready: Receipt or definitive refusal
  Pending --> Recovery: Reply lost or receipt missing
  Recovery --> Pending: Check outcome with unchanged proposal
  Recovery --> Recovery: Changed proposal or failed check
  Recovery --> Ready: Read shows resolved
  Ready --> Retired: Authorization fails
  Pending --> Retired: Authorization fails
  Recovery --> Retired: Session invalidated
  Ready --> Disposed: Close guide
  Pending --> Disposed: Close guide
  Recovery --> Disposed: Close guide
  %% never Send an opposite or newly keyed decision while an outcome is unknown.
  %% never Replay a write automatically.
